    mechanism: ['Query rewriting improves search vocabulary; multi-query search broadens coverage. Both can drift from the original intent.', 'HyDE generates a hypothetical answer/document to embed for retrieval. Treat that generated text as a search aid, never as verified evidence.', 'GraphRAG can exploit extracted entities/relationships and summaries for connected questions. Agentic retrieval chooses additional search steps dynamically.'],
