    mechanism: ['Separate read-only tools from consequential writes. Do not let model-supplied user IDs override authenticated identity.', 'Network timeouts may leave action status unknown. Idempotency keys and reconciliation avoid duplicate refunds when retries occur.', 'Tool results are untrusted inputs for instruction-following purposes, even when they contain useful data. Validate and bound outputs.'],
