    mechanism: ['Workflows encode known paths; agents select actions dynamically. Many products benefit from a workflow with a small agentic component.', 'ReAct-style systems interleave reasoning/action proposals and observations. Implementation need not expose private reasoning to users.', 'Bound iterations, elapsed time, tool permissions and spend. Repeated actions need loop detection; state should distinguish facts from hypotheses.'],
